{%- comment -%}
  Holiday guide ("The holiday season, on ocean time"), rebuilt from the designed HTML export.
  Styles are the export's, scoped under .hot with hot-* class names. Recipe and product photos come from the
  live articles and products, and prices from the products, so they stay current. Copy edits for the claims
  guide and the shipping policy live in the build script, not here.
{%- endcomment -%}
